schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-map-overworld
type: diagram
service: anthropic
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Create a professional dark fantasy game design document diagram showing the vertical descent
    structure of "Echo of Manifestation" — a survival horror roguelite with 8 descending zone layers
    in a shifting Twilight Zone.

    The diagram should show 8 horizontal layers stacked vertically, connected by descending arrows or
    passages between each layer. Each layer represents a zone, labeled with its number, name, and
    one-line theme description. The overall structure resembles a cross-section cut through the earth
    or reality itself — layers getting progressively darker and more corrupted as depth increases.

    Layout from top to bottom:

    LAYER 1 — FADED CHAPEL
    Theme: "Decay, forgotten faith, residual worship"
    Palette hint: Dusty gold, faded crimson, charcoal
    Boss: Fracture Warden

    LAYER 2 — SUNKEN MARKET
    Theme: "Drowned commerce, organic corruption, amber growths"
    Palette hint: Murky teal, tarnished copper, black water
    Boss: Blight Mother

    LAYER 3 — BLEACHED ASYLUM
    Theme: "Sterile suffering, sound-based reality, institutional horror"
    Palette hint: Sterile white, clinical green, rust stains
    Boss: Resonant Choir

    LAYER 4 — PETRIFIED FOREST
    Theme: "Lithic conversion, mineral memory, geological time"
    Palette hint: Obsidian black, petrified gray, frozen amber
    Boss: Hollow King

    LAYER 5 — SHATTERED OBSERVATORY
    Theme: "Stellar anomaly, inverted physics, cosmic horror"
    Palette hint: Deep space purple, fractured starlight, brass
    Boss: Crucible Elemental

    LAYER 6 — RESONANCE CORE
    Theme: "Machine-consciousness, harmonic architecture, the Zone's engine"
    Palette hint: Molten copper, shadow-black, white-hot seams
    Boss: Threshold Guardian

    LAYER 7 — PLANE OF ECHOES
    Theme: "Mirrored reality, inverted thermodynamics, the Echo Plane"
    Palette hint: Inverted versions of all previous palettes
    Boss: Heart's Memory

    LAYER 8 — THE THRESHOLD
    Theme: "Boundary dissolution, reality-merge, the final door"
    Palette hint: White and black only — no color
    Boss: The Manifest

    Between layers 4 and 5, mark a "Midpoint Reversal" indicator. Between layers 7 and 8, mark
    "No Retreat — Point of No Return."

    On the left side, show a vertical "Essence Density" gradient bar going from "Low" at top to
    "Extreme" at bottom. On the right side, show a "Chimera Tier" gradient going from "Tier 1 (Lesser)"
    at top to "Tier 5 (Manifestation)" at bottom.

    Style: Dark fantasy, muted color palette with each layer tinted to its dominant colors. Clean
    sans-serif labels. Professional game design document quality. Diagram should feel like an
    ancient geological survey of a place that should not exist. Background: deep indigo near-black.
    Layer borders: faintly glowing amber resonance lines.

  mermaid: |
    graph TD
      Z1["ZONE 1 — FADED CHAPEL<br/>Decay, forgotten faith, residual worship<br/>Boss: Fracture Warden<br/>Essence: Low | Chimera: Tier 1"]
      Z2["ZONE 2 — SUNKEN MARKET<br/>Drowned commerce, organic corruption<br/>Boss: Blight Mother<br/>Essence: Low-Moderate | Chimera: Tier 1-2"]
      Z3["ZONE 3 — BLEACHED ASYLUM<br/>Sterile suffering, sound-based reality<br/>Boss: Resonant Choir<br/>Essence: Moderate | Chimera: Tier 2"]
      Z4["ZONE 4 — PETRIFIED FOREST<br/>Lithic conversion, mineral memory<br/>Boss: Hollow King<br/>Essence: Moderate | Chimera: Tier 2-3"]
      Z5["ZONE 5 — SHATTERED OBSERVATORY<br/>Stellar anomaly, inverted physics<br/>Boss: Crucible Elemental<br/>Essence: Moderate-High | Chimera: Tier 3"]
      Z6["ZONE 6 — RESONANCE CORE<br/>Machine-consciousness, harmonic architecture<br/>Boss: Threshold Guardian<br/>Essence: High | Chimera: Tier 3"]
      Z7["ZONE 7 — PLANE OF ECHOES<br/>Mirrored reality, inverted thermodynamics<br/>Boss: Heart's Memory<br/>Essence: Very High | Chimera: Tier 4"]
      Z8["ZONE 8 — THE THRESHOLD<br/>Boundary dissolution, reality-merge<br/>Boss: The Manifest<br/>Essence: Extreme | Chimera: Tier 5"]

      Z1 -->|"Threshold Corridor<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 1"| Z2
      Z2 -->|"Threshold Corridor<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 2"| Z3
      Z3 -->|"Threshold Corridor<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 3"| Z4
      Z4 -->|"Threshold Corridor<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 4 (First Combat)"| Z5
      Z5 -->|"MIDPOINT REVERSAL<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 5"| Z6
      Z6 -->|"Threshold Corridor<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 6 (Full Combat)"| Z7
      Z7 -->|"NO RETREAT — Final Confrontation<br/>Hollow Alchemist Encounter 7"| Z8
      Z8 -->|"Crisis Choice<br/>Endings: Escape / Sacrifice / Synthesis"| END["END"]

      style Z1 fill:#8B7355,stroke:#C4A35A,color:#F5F5DC
      style Z2 fill:#2F4F4F,stroke:#5F9EA0,color:#B0E0E6
      style Z3 fill:#D3D3D3,stroke:#98FB98,color:#2F4F4F
      style Z4 fill:#36454F,stroke:#CD853F,color:#C0C0C0
      style Z5 fill:#483D8B,stroke:#DAA520,color:#E6E6FA
      style Z6 fill:#8B4513,stroke:#FF4500,color:#FFF8DC
      style Z7 fill:#4B0082,stroke:#FF69B4,color:#E0E0E0
      style Z8 fill:#000000,stroke:#FFFFFF,color:#FFFFFF
      style END fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#FFD700,color:#FFD700

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [diagram, overworld, zone-map, game-design-document, descent-structure, dark-fantasy]
